      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Clip Prompt Fixer\n\nRewrites a few clips. Lyrics and timings stay locked.\n\n1. Same Builder pack as the original run (mode, refs, song). Builder still needs a patched H3 on `model_1`.\n2. Paste the Music Video or Auto Chain prompt.\n3. Set `clip_index` (`11-12` or `11,12`).\n4. Write a Plan of what should change.\n5. Queue. Local Prompter writes the selected `## Clip` sections into **Prompts**.\n\nThen paste those clips back into Music Video / Auto Chain (or a Clip Fixer graph).\n\nYou can also click **Copy skill command** and paste `/prompt-minimax-h3-clip-fix` into an agent.\n\nQueue this graph **without** generating video. Local Prompter unloads H3 while it runs.\n\nPrefer an [agent skill](https://github.com/kex0/ComfyUI-H3-Studio/tree/main/skills) over Local Prompter when you can — the results are better.\n"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## Clip Prompt Fixer\n\nRewrites a few clips. Lyrics and timings stay locked.\n\n1. Same Builder pack as the original run (mode, refs, song). Builder still needs a patched H3 on `model_1`.\n2. Paste the Music Video or Auto Chain prompt.\n3. Set `clip_index` (`11-12` or `11,12`).\n4. Write a Plan of what should change.\n5. Queue. Local Prompter writes the selected `## Clip` sections into **Prompts**.\n\nThen paste those clips back into Music Video / Auto Chain (or a Clip Fixer graph).\n\nYou can also click **Copy skill command** and paste `/prompt-minimax-h3-clip-fix` into an agent.\n\nQueue this graph **without** generating video. Local Prompter unloads H3 while it runs.\n\nPrefer an [agent skill](https://github.com/kex0/ComfyUI-H3-Studio/tree/main/skills) over Local Prompter when you can — the results are better.\n"
      },
